    {
      "source": "A simple bootstrap context that is available during startup and <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/Environment.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>Environment</code></a>\npost-processing up to the point that the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/ApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationContext</code></a> is prepared.",
      "translation": "一个在启动期间可用的简单 bootstrap 上下文，以及直到 <code>ApplicationContext</code> 准备就绪为止的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/Environment.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>Environment</code></a> 后处理。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/ApplicationEvent.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationEvent</code></a> published by a <a href=\"BootstrapContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.bootstrap\"><code>BootstrapContext</code></a> when it's closed.",
      "translation": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/ApplicationEvent.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationEvent</code></a> 由 <a href=\"BootstrapContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.bootstrap\"><code>BootstrapContext</code></a> 在关闭时发布。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "A simple object registry that is available during startup and <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/Environment.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>Environment</code></a>\npost-processing up to the point that the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/ApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationContext</code></a> is prepared.",
      "translation": "一个在启动期间可用，并在 `<code>Environment</code>` 后处理到 `<code>ApplicationContext</code>` 准备就绪的简单对象注册表。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "A <a href=\"BootstrapContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.bootstrap\"><code>BootstrapContext</code></a> that also provides configuration methods through the\n<a href=\"BootstrapRegistry.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.bootstrap\"><code>BootstrapRegistry</code></a> interface.",
      "translation": "一个也通过 <a href=\"BootstrapRegistry.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.bootstrap\"><code>BootstrapRegistry</code></a> 接口提供配置方法的 <a href=\"BootstrapContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.bootstrap\"><code>BootstrapContext</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Callback interface that can be used to initialize a <a href=\"BootstrapRegistry.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.bootstrap\"><code>BootstrapRegistry</code></a> before it\nis used.",
      "translation": "可用于在首次使用之前初始化<a href=\"BootstrapRegistry.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.bootstrap\"><code>BootstrapRegistry</code></a>的回调接口。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
